{"translation":{"id":"kan_okcv","name":"Biblica® ಉಚಿತ ಕನ್ನಡ ಸಮಕಾಲಿಕ ಭಾಷಾಂತರ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanokcv","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanokcv","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"OKCV","englishName":"Kanada Open Contemporary Version Bible","language":"kan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"579eda1a2f0787e978bfdd1e238e1f22be5be659c98add6930ad2d796778f705","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31090,"languageName":"ಕನ್ನಡ","languageEnglishName":"Kannada"},"book":{"id":"JOB","translationId":"kan_okcv","name":"ಯೋಬ","commonName":"ಯೋಬ","title":"ಯೋಬ","order":18,"numberOfChapters":42,"sha256":"b0f83c520d9f9fe88a86928196fe42cb3f2ca42af0fcb52b6aedc35fc7902203","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/JOB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":42,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/JOB/42.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1070},"chapter":{"number":25,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ಬಿಲ್ದದನ ಉತ್ತರ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["ಶೂಹ್ಯನಾದ ಬಿಲ್ದದನು ಉತ್ತರಕೊಟ್ಟು ಹೇಳಿದ್ದೇನೆಂದರೆ:"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"“ಅಧಿಕಾರ ಮತ್ತು ವಿಸ್ಮಯ ದೇವರಿಗೆ ಸೇರಿದೆ;","poem":1},{"text":"ಉನ್ನತಲೋಕದಲ್ಲಿ ಸಮಾಧಾನವನ್ನು ಸ್ಥಾಪಿಸಿದವರು ದೇವರೇ.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"ದೇವರ ಸೈನ್ಯಗಳಿಗೆ ಲೆಕ್ಕ ಉಂಟೋ?","poem":1},{"text":"ಯಾರ ಮೇಲೆ ದೇವರ ಬೆಳಕು ಮೂಡುವುದಿಲ್ಲ?","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"ಮನುಷ್ಯನು ದೇವರ ಮುಂದೆ ನೀತಿವಂತನಾಗುವುದು ಹೇಗೆ?","poem":1},{"text":"ಸ್ತ್ರೀಯಿಂದ ಹುಟ್ಟಿದವನು ಪರಿಶುದ್ಧನಾಗಿರುವುದು ಹೇಗೆ?","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"ಇಗೋ, ಚಂದ್ರನೂ ಪ್ರಕಾಶಮಾನವಾಗಿರುವದಿಲ್ಲ;","poem":1},{"text":"ನಕ್ಷತ್ರಗಳಾದರೂ ದೇವರ ದೃಷ್ಟಿಗೆ ಶುದ್ಧವಾದವುಗಳಲ್ಲ.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"ಹೀಗಿರುವಲ್ಲಿ ಹುಳುವಿನಂಥ ಮನುಷ್ಯನು ದೇವರ ದೃಷ್ಟಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಎಷ್ಟೋ ಕಡಿಮೆ!","poem":1},{"text":"ಕ್ರಿಮಿಯಂಥ ಮನವರು ಎಷ್ಟೋ ಅಲ್ಪರು!”","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kan_okcv/JOB/25.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/JOB/26.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/JOB/24.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}